 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:08Z (RFD66606-2495) '  at adjusted Rand index (ARI, 1 for the same grouping, 0 for chance) 0.985. The example's
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:09Z (RFD66606-2495) '  own maps give 0.981 and a shuffled truth gives 0.0.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:10Z (RFD66606-2495) '- A first set of GarmentCode runs scored ARI 0.015 to 0.22 and was wrong. Segment looks each
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:11Z (RFD66606-2495) '  label up by nearest neighbour between the source file's own coordinates and its output,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:12Z (RFD66606-2495) '  which sits in a unit cube. The source was in centimetres, 170 units tall, so the lookup
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:13Z (RFD66606-2495) '  distance was 94 units instead of 0.0007. Those numbers are withdrawn. Every result below
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:14Z (RFD66606-2495) '  used a source normalised into the unit cube.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:15Z (RFD66606-2495) '- One GarmentCode garment, eight Hammersley views, maps rendered from its exact labels with
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:16Z (RFD66606-2495) '  one colour per class or panel, scored against the true labels. On the neutral body, with
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:17Z (RFD66606-2495) '  a red cloth and a skin texture, semantic maps give ARI 0.81 against the five true classes
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:18Z (RFD66606-2495) '  and 0.61 against panels. Instance maps give 0.60 against classes and 0.75 against panels.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:19Z (RFD66606-2495) '  Shuffled controls sit at 0.00. The garment alone reaches 0.97 on classes with semantic maps.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

