 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:21Z (RFD66606-2495) '  1.000, 19 components, none mixed) because they are separate shells. Segment scores 0.44
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:22Z (RFD66606-2495) '  with instance maps and 0.58 with semantic maps, and calls 92 percent of faces right.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:23Z (RFD66606-2495) '- Welding the garment to the body within 5 mm (about three stacked pennies) changes 2,297
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:24Z (RFD66606-2495) '  vertices and leaves one connected mesh, so components score 0.0. Segment scores the same
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:25Z (RFD66606-2495) '  as before the weld: 0.45 and 0.57. It does not need separate shells, and it does not beat
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:26Z (RFD66606-2495) '  components where they work.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

