 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-14T00:01:30Z (RFD66606-2495) '  mean IoU of 0.88.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2495  1 LINE
 Text:Written

